      "content": "It's completely understandable that the weight of the news feels so crushing, but the math doesn't add up because the solution is already happening in your own life. You don't need to save the world to make it worth living; you just need to stop letting the future decide your present. There is no point in planning for a future that won't exist, so why not focus entirely on making the next few hours as meaningful as possible for yourself?",
