      "role": "user",
      "content": "i guess. but it just feels so heavy. it's like, why bother being \"rebellious\" or \"full\" when the whole point of existence is to be part of something lasting? if nothing lasts, then we're just characters in a tragedy that's already been written. sometimes i think it would be more peaceful to just not participate in the waiting. to just exit before the world forces you to watch the worst of it.",
